WEBVTT

00:11.500 --> 00:14.320
<i>Aizawa Azusa, age 27.</i>

00:11.670 --> 00:14.640
<b>Aizawa Azusa
Age Twenty-Seven</b>

00:14.640 --> 00:16.650
<b>Corporate Slave</b>

00:15.000 --> 00:15.980
<i>Corporate slave.</i>

00:23.040 --> 00:25.830
<i>I sacrificed love, fun, and everything else</i>

00:25.830 --> 00:28.730
<i>to live only for my career.</i>

00:29.970 --> 00:32.670
<i>Whatever happened to the Labor Standards Act?</i>

00:33.620 --> 00:35.220
<i>Then, one day...</i>

00:39.620 --> 00:42.210
<b>Worked to Death</b>

00:43.270 --> 00:44.550
<i>However!</i>

00:44.890 --> 00:47.310
<i>Thanks to a very kind goddess...</i>

00:49.150 --> 00:52.630
<i>I was reincarnated in another 
world as an immortal witch!</i>

00:53.040 --> 00:55.820
<i>One who's forever seventeen, at that!</i>

00:57.230 --> 01:01.120
<i>I went on to enjoy a slow life in 
a little house in the highlands,</i>

01:01.410 --> 01:04.730
<i>doing nothing but killing 
slimes for 300 years...</i>

01:07.130 --> 01:12.130
I've Been Killing Slimes for 300 Years
and Maxed Out My Level Season 2

01:07.360 --> 01:10.970
<i>and before I knew it, I'd maxed out my level!</i>

01:12.830 --> 01:15.800
<i>And after I lived alone all those years,</i>

01:15.800 --> 01:18.550
<i>I met lots of wonderful new 
companions, one after another...</i>

01:21.440 --> 01:23.550
<b>Laika 
Red Dragon Girl</b>

01:30.670 --> 01:32.640
<b>Falfa 
Slime Spirit (Older Sister)</b>

01:30.670 --> 01:32.640
<b>Shalsha 
Slime Spirit (Younger Sister)</b>

01:36.840 --> 01:39.900
<b>Halkara 
Elf Apothecary</b>

01:49.210 --> 01:50.990
<b>Flatorte 
Blue Dragon Girl</b>

01:55.820 --> 01:57.410
<b>Rosalie 
Ghost Girl</b>

02:05.620 --> 02:07.380
<b>Fatla 
Leviathan Secretary (Older Sister)</b>

02:06.620 --> 02:09.210
<b>Beelzebub 
High Demon</b>

02:07.620 --> 02:10.550
<b>Pecora 
Demon King</b>

02:08.620 --> 02:10.550
<b>Vania 
Leviathan Secretary (Younger Sister)</b>

02:11.140 --> 02:14.200
<i>And before I knew it, I had a family!</i>

02:41.620 --> 02:42.660
Morning!

02:43.740 --> 02:46.020
Good morning, Sister!

02:46.020 --> 02:47.330
Morning!

02:47.330 --> 02:48.890
Morning, Mama!

03:00.740 --> 03:01.870
Morning!

03:01.870 --> 03:04.160
Good morning, Lady Azusa.

03:04.490 --> 03:05.380
Here you go.

03:28.300 --> 03:30.410
You're late, Flatorte!

03:30.410 --> 03:32.390
Honestly, you do this every single day!

03:33.660 --> 03:35.480
Good morning!

03:38.650 --> 03:40.250
Let's eat!

03:42.240 --> 03:45.330
<b>Along Came a Goddess</b>

03:46.130 --> 03:48.990
Laika, this bread is delicious!

03:49.350 --> 03:51.470
I was able to procure some fine cheese,

03:51.470 --> 03:53.550
so I put a bit on top and toasted it.

03:54.780 --> 03:57.500
I recommend drizzling on some honey to taste.

03:57.980 --> 04:00.010
It's such a nice combination!

04:00.990 --> 04:02.840
Not bad at all!

04:02.840 --> 04:04.640
Please eat more slowly!

04:11.550 --> 04:14.220
The honey's so sweet and yummy!

04:14.500 --> 04:16.770
It makes me feel so happy.

04:18.340 --> 04:20.920
It's so nice out today.

04:20.920 --> 04:23.280
It makes me want to go out and wander around.

04:23.560 --> 04:24.630
Oh, right.

04:24.630 --> 04:28.150
Laika, I'd like to make the long 
trip to the southern forest today.

04:28.150 --> 04:29.450
Could you give me a ride?

04:29.640 --> 04:32.460
Yes, of course, Lady Azusa!

04:32.460 --> 04:34.870
In that case, I'll accompany you, too.

04:34.870 --> 04:37.840
The southern forest has some great mushrooms!

04:38.040 --> 04:40.960
Why do you want to go to a place so far away?

04:41.460 --> 04:43.470
I want to gather medicinal herbs.

04:43.830 --> 04:46.600
I gotta act like a witch sometimes, y'know?

04:53.660 --> 04:56.560
I didn't know there was a place 
like this near the forest!

04:57.190 --> 04:59.500
It's a type of produce called "rice."

04:59.500 --> 05:01.960
It should be just about ready to harvest.

05:02.540 --> 05:05.600
<i>So they have rice in this world, too!</i>

05:07.520 --> 05:08.410
What's that?

05:09.520 --> 05:11.460
Those are red beans.

05:11.460 --> 05:13.910
They soften when you boil them.

05:14.370 --> 05:17.510
<i>I guess they're similar to azuki beans?</i>

05:18.010 --> 05:19.380
<i>Azuki...</i>

05:19.770 --> 05:21.170
I know!

05:26.830 --> 05:27.610
Okay!

05:28.190 --> 05:31.430
I bought lots of red beans...

05:31.810 --> 05:33.520
And this is flour, right?

05:34.000 --> 05:36.650
You guys don't seem very familiar with rice.

05:36.650 --> 05:39.150
Are you going to cook something, Master?

05:39.340 --> 05:40.390
Yep!

05:40.390 --> 05:44.400
I thought I'd make something 
sweet for Falfa and Shalsha.

05:45.240 --> 05:46.510
That's wonderful!

05:46.510 --> 05:48.860
I'll use the beans to make anko first.

05:49.120 --> 05:51.330
Anko? What is that?

05:51.760 --> 05:53.450
Where are Falfa and Shalsha?

05:53.960 --> 05:56.030
They're both having their nap.

05:56.330 --> 05:58.940
And... Sister Flatorte, as well.

05:59.880 --> 06:01.900
Okay, then, let's do this 
while they're asleep!

06:01.900 --> 06:03.770
Will you three help me out?

06:04.030 --> 06:05.460
Yes!

06:04.030 --> 06:05.460
You got it!

06:04.030 --> 06:05.460
You can count on us!

06:27.880 --> 06:30.300
Oh... So these are manju?

06:31.010 --> 06:33.180
They have quite an interesting shape.

06:33.870 --> 06:37.040
Hmm... This isn't quite right...

06:38.860 --> 06:40.380
How about these?

06:42.380 --> 06:44.950
Uh, no. Not even close.

06:44.950 --> 06:47.990
W-Well, I don't think they're so bad...

06:47.990 --> 06:51.220
But they could stand to be a bit less dry.

06:53.040 --> 06:57.310
You might want to add more moisture 
to the dough to make it softer!

06:57.610 --> 06:59.940
Flatorte! When did you come in here?!

07:00.350 --> 07:04.230
Cooking is a series of repeated 
failures and successes.

07:04.560 --> 07:07.150
Master, give it another try!

07:08.260 --> 07:09.400
Right...

07:09.960 --> 07:12.390
Everyone, let's try again!

07:12.390 --> 07:13.780
Okay!

07:12.390 --> 07:13.780
Right!

07:12.390 --> 07:13.780
You got it!

07:19.860 --> 07:22.070
Please wrap them more carefully!

07:22.460 --> 07:25.270
Red Dragons are such sticklers for detail.

07:25.750 --> 07:27.960
You can be approximate 
with this kind of thing.

07:38.240 --> 07:40.810
All right! These look great!

07:40.810 --> 07:44.150
Ooh, something smells yummy!

07:44.620 --> 07:46.020
Perfect timing!

07:46.930 --> 07:48.340
What are these?

07:48.340 --> 07:49.650
I've never seen them before.

07:49.650 --> 07:53.260
They're a sweet, tasty snack called manju.

07:53.260 --> 07:55.340
The others helped me make them.

07:55.340 --> 07:56.280
Try some!

07:58.570 --> 07:59.910
It's warm.

08:00.360 --> 08:02.510
Yay! Let's eat!

08:11.510 --> 08:14.640
I love it! It's so good!

08:14.900 --> 08:19.140
What a wholesome flavor. It warms my heart.

08:19.160 --> 08:27.390
<b>Ka-zing</b>

08:21.020 --> 08:22.990
I could die happy right now!

08:22.990 --> 08:27.070
This might be what I've been 
living for these past 300 years!

08:27.560 --> 08:31.320
Amazing, Mama! 
You're so good at making sweets!

08:31.650 --> 08:33.600
It's so delicious, I'm shaking.

08:34.210 --> 08:36.160
What a gentle flavor.

08:36.160 --> 08:38.970
The sweet beans stuffed 
inside the soft dough—

08:38.970 --> 08:42.150
These are good! 
I could keep eating them forever!

08:43.410 --> 08:45.970
Master, you could sell these!

08:46.230 --> 08:49.130
Uh, really? You think they'd sell?

08:50.930 --> 08:54.720
Hey, Mama! These look kinda like slimes!

08:55.450 --> 08:58.220
They might looks cute with faces on them!

09:02.280 --> 09:04.480
People of Flatta!

09:04.720 --> 09:06.790
Behold the sweet, delicious snack

09:06.790 --> 09:09.980
made with care by the Witch of 
the Highlands, "Snack Slimes."

09:10.280 --> 09:12.480
On sale now!

09:12.850 --> 09:14.460
Witch of the Highlands!

09:14.460 --> 09:17.110
Have you come up with some new product?

09:17.280 --> 09:20.420
Natalie! I appreciate 
all you do at the guild.

09:20.420 --> 09:21.370
Try one!

09:21.700 --> 09:24.120
Oh, what cute sweets!

09:24.330 --> 09:26.390
They're shaped like slimes!

09:26.390 --> 09:27.620
You're right!

09:27.620 --> 09:30.460
Come on, everyone! Try some!

09:33.970 --> 09:36.680
Wow! It's delicious! What is this?!

09:36.680 --> 09:40.030
A soft bread filled with beans 
boiled until they're sweet...

09:40.030 --> 09:42.100
It's like nothing I've ever had before!

09:42.100 --> 09:44.480
If you like them, buy some, okay?

09:44.910 --> 09:47.480
Falfa's really good at handling customers.

09:47.790 --> 09:50.380
She was the one who suggested 
offering samples, too.

09:50.720 --> 09:54.330
My sister spares no effort 
when playing pretend.

09:54.330 --> 09:56.130
Even when she imitated a grasshopper,

09:56.130 --> 09:59.490
she closely observed how 
they jump and everything.

10:00.010 --> 10:02.260
<i>This isn't pretend, though...</i>

10:02.260 --> 10:04.090
<i>We're dealing with customers for real.</i>

10:04.580 --> 10:06.840
I'll take a box! No, two boxes!

10:06.840 --> 10:08.180
Three boxes for me!

10:08.460 --> 10:09.540
Here you go.

10:08.460 --> 10:09.540
Me, too, please!

10:09.750 --> 10:11.070
Rosalie!

10:11.070 --> 10:12.420
Here ya go!

10:12.700 --> 10:15.150
<i>I'm glad they're going over so well.</i>

10:15.690 --> 10:17.840
That's the Witch of the Highlands for you.

10:17.840 --> 10:19.920
She's great with food and drinks!

10:20.190 --> 10:22.810
You're right. Her coffee shop was great, too.

10:22.810 --> 10:25.430
I guess this is her specialty, huh?

10:26.790 --> 10:31.690
<i>Oh, crap! I was supposed to be 
acting witch-like for a change!</i>

10:33.390 --> 10:36.150
<i>But it looks like these 
two are having fun, so...</i>

10:36.150 --> 10:37.590
<i>I guess it's all good.</i>

10:40.190 --> 10:41.770
Cheers!

10:41.770 --> 10:43.570
Great work, everyone!

10:43.570 --> 10:46.560
I never expected them to sell out so quickly!

10:46.770 --> 10:48.810
They were a huge hit!

10:48.810 --> 10:50.940
It was so much fun!

10:50.940 --> 10:54.490
Master, now that sales have taken off,

10:54.490 --> 10:56.590
why not try something new?

10:57.260 --> 10:58.470
Like what?

10:58.800 --> 11:00.720
Stamp cards!

11:00.720 --> 11:05.220
You give a stamp to everyone who buys 
from you to encourage repeat visits.

11:05.220 --> 11:07.470
They're all the rage right now.

11:10.390 --> 11:13.980
This is the goddess Mega-mega's 
Virtue Stamp Card.

11:14.280 --> 11:16.860
That's exactly right, Shalsha!

11:17.270 --> 11:21.650
The goddess Mega-mega has earned followers 
by being a god you can meet in person.

11:21.650 --> 11:23.990
She's the most up-and-coming god right now.

11:24.340 --> 11:26.500
Gods can be up-and-coming?

11:26.900 --> 11:29.030
She holds talk shows in various regions,

11:29.030 --> 11:31.340
and when people hear her blessed words,

11:31.340 --> 11:34.570
they receive blessings that 
are relevant to their lives,

11:34.570 --> 11:40.050
like physical healing, getting into 
college, or finding a missing sock.

11:40.430 --> 11:42.120
<i>That's a little too specific...</i>

11:42.600 --> 11:48.680
The goddess Mega-mega says accumulating 
virtue in this way leads to miracles.

11:49.170 --> 11:51.840
I got an offer for a collaboration 
with my energy drinks

11:51.840 --> 11:54.440
and gained a stamp for it!

11:54.670 --> 11:55.860
Huh...

11:56.820 --> 11:58.220
Sister, look.

12:01.770 --> 12:06.200
It looks like the goddess Mega-mega 
is holding an event in the capital.

12:06.410 --> 12:08.590
That's kinda far away, though.

12:08.590 --> 12:09.660
Mother...

12:10.700 --> 12:12.180
I want to go!

12:12.520 --> 12:15.450
<b>Ka-zing</b>

12:15.460 --> 12:18.960
I've Been Killing Slimes for 300 Years
and Maxed Out My Level Season 2

12:18.980 --> 12:22.460
<b>Provincial Capital Vitamei</b>

12:21.350 --> 12:24.720
So none of the others came along in the end.

12:25.070 --> 12:26.860
Not interested.

12:26.860 --> 12:28.470
I'll stay home.

12:28.690 --> 12:30.680
I don't know about seeing a god...

12:30.680 --> 12:32.530
I could see you there and back...

12:33.680 --> 12:36.560
Everyone has their own degree 
of closeness with the gods.

12:36.560 --> 12:39.480
I guess so. Shalsha sure seems happy.

12:39.880 --> 12:42.830
My heart has never soared so high.

12:43.450 --> 12:46.510
I must give thanks to this day, 
the day I meet a god.

12:46.900 --> 12:49.000
<i>She's unusually talkative.</i>

12:49.520 --> 12:53.850
Shalsha, what are the 
gods of this world like?

12:55.970 --> 12:58.160
Roughly 1,500 years ago,

12:58.160 --> 13:01.840
there was a faction of scholars that 
considered "gods" to be a "concept"

13:01.840 --> 13:05.890
and a faction that believed them to 
exist, resulting in an inquisition.

13:06.470 --> 13:10.140
But because all the gods appeared 
right there on the spot,

13:10.140 --> 13:12.020
the debate was quickly resolved.

13:12.170 --> 13:14.270
<i>That's a shocking conclusion...</i>

13:14.810 --> 13:19.400
So the accepted theological 
belief now is that gods exist.

13:19.750 --> 13:21.980
Over time, the god industry matured,

13:21.980 --> 13:27.150
and the latest trend is gods declaring that 
they'll grant people's secular wishes.

13:27.560 --> 13:30.210
<i>God industry? That feels a bit too real...</i>

13:30.540 --> 13:34.090
And the one who stands 
out the most right now...

13:34.560 --> 13:37.370
...is the goddess Mega-mega, huh?

13:38.080 --> 13:40.580
What is this, a concert 
by some famous singer?

13:43.530 --> 13:45.830
<b>Event Venue</b>

13:44.550 --> 13:45.840
<i>If anything, it feels like</i>

13:45.840 --> 13:48.500
<i>a veteran singer's dinner show!</i>

13:49.670 --> 13:52.280
Yes, they're serving all types, I see.

13:53.760 --> 13:56.190
Thank you all for waiting.

13:56.190 --> 13:59.710
The goddess Mega-mega 
will now take the stage!

14:03.690 --> 14:08.200
Mega-mega! Mega-mega! Mega-mega!

14:08.410 --> 14:11.270
Okay, now it's a folk music 
show at a hot springs resort!

14:11.710 --> 14:14.580
And now, here she is!

14:22.510 --> 14:25.590
Hi, everyone! 
Are you accumulating lots of virtue?!

14:25.590 --> 14:26.340
Huh?

14:26.340 --> 14:27.090
Huh?

14:27.090 --> 14:27.970
Huh?!

14:28.290 --> 14:29.840
Here we go!

14:36.160 --> 14:37.950
M-Master?!

14:37.950 --> 14:39.270
Mother?

14:39.470 --> 14:42.020
What's this, now? You are...

14:42.400 --> 14:44.690
Yes! The very same!

14:45.840 --> 14:47.440
...who, again?

14:47.440 --> 14:48.570
Flop!

14:49.270 --> 14:50.630
Azusa?!

14:50.630 --> 14:53.620
Oh, gosh! I remember you! What a coincidence!

14:54.090 --> 14:56.870
Mother, you know the goddess Mega-mega?

14:57.560 --> 15:02.850
So, Goddess Mega-mega, why did you 
decide to descend to this world?

15:03.340 --> 15:06.770
Well, you see, there is a 
hierarchy among the gods.

15:07.070 --> 15:11.050
The high-ranking gods unify the many worlds,

15:11.050 --> 15:15.970
and the low-ranking gods are assigned 
specific worlds to rule over.

15:15.970 --> 15:19.000
<i>Reminds me of how my company 
worked in my former life...</i>

15:19.450 --> 15:23.040
Naturally, I was in a unifying role,

15:23.040 --> 15:27.110
but I wished to see the smiles of 
the people of each world in person,

15:27.480 --> 15:31.110
so I voluntarily came down to this world!

15:34.270 --> 15:40.810
I hear you've also come up with a 
new idea to make our world better.

15:40.810 --> 15:41.620
Yes!

15:41.980 --> 15:45.390
And that is... this Virtue Stamp Card!

15:48.360 --> 15:52.950
When you feel that you've done a 
good deed and accumulated virtue,

15:52.950 --> 15:54.930
draw a circle on this card.

15:55.240 --> 15:58.890
Of course, you may receive circles 
from other people, as well.

15:59.180 --> 16:02.300
And what happens when all 
the spaces are filled in?

16:02.300 --> 16:03.900
Nothing!

16:04.110 --> 16:05.020
Wha?

16:05.020 --> 16:06.710
Nothing at all!

16:06.710 --> 16:09.660
You get your next card and earn more stamps!

16:09.890 --> 16:13.030
Accumulating virtue is a 
task that should never end!

16:14.980 --> 16:17.110
<i>I mean, yeah, I guess she's right.</i>

16:19.390 --> 16:23.040
Thank you all for listening so attentively!

16:28.900 --> 16:29.890
Huh?

16:30.840 --> 16:32.820
I am deeply moved.

16:33.060 --> 16:36.300
Hearing a god speak will be 
a memory I'll carry forever.

16:38.150 --> 16:42.750
Master, didn't Mega-mega ask 
you to stop by her green room?

16:42.750 --> 16:45.780
Oh, that's right. I'll be back soon.

16:46.060 --> 16:48.020
See you later!

16:48.570 --> 16:50.280
I await good news.

16:51.020 --> 16:53.050
<i>I wonder what she wants to talk about.</i>

16:53.810 --> 16:56.830
Accumulating virtue is a 
task that should never end!

16:57.440 --> 17:03.050
<i>That would mean, since I'm immortal, 
I need to keep accumulating virtue forever.</i>

17:03.330 --> 17:07.450
<i>But can I say with confidence 
that I've accumulated virtue?</i>

17:07.450 --> 17:10.380
<i>I haven't really done 
anything witch-like at all.</i>

17:12.650 --> 17:16.890
<i>Wait... Is that what the 
goddess wants to talk about?</i>

17:17.320 --> 17:21.320
<i>Since I've lived for so long, 
is she gonna send me to another world?</i>

17:21.940 --> 17:24.380
<i>Am I not going to be immortal anymore?</i>

17:25.480 --> 17:28.930
<i>No! This world...</i>

17:29.750 --> 17:32.400
<i>And my family... I love them all!</i>

17:34.340 --> 17:35.390
Come in.

17:38.930 --> 17:41.240
It's been quite some time, Azusa.

17:41.880 --> 17:44.040
Um, Goddess...

17:44.630 --> 17:45.520
Yes?

17:46.060 --> 17:50.000
I want to keep living in this world forever!

17:50.270 --> 17:51.580
Okay, go ahead!

17:51.580 --> 17:55.760
Live here for another 3,000 years, 
30,000 years, or as long as you like!

17:56.500 --> 17:57.500
Huh?

18:01.800 --> 18:04.250
Thanks for picking us up, Laika!

18:05.210 --> 18:10.500
Master, what did you and the 
goddess Mega-mega talk about?

18:10.500 --> 18:11.860
I am most interested.

18:12.220 --> 18:14.120
Huh? Well, um...

18:14.120 --> 18:18.020
I told her about the current 
state of my life, where I live...

18:18.360 --> 18:20.620
Nothing that important, really.

18:20.620 --> 18:23.400
Oh, is that all?

18:24.200 --> 18:28.980
So gods are interested in idle chats 
and the goings-on of everyday life.

18:31.430 --> 18:33.130
You were demoted?!

18:33.130 --> 18:34.900
That's right.

18:34.900 --> 18:37.990
You know how I have a soft 
spot for women, right?

18:38.350 --> 18:43.140
It turns out reincarnating everyone 
as young girls and forever seventeens

18:43.140 --> 18:46.020
was actually seen as a problem...

18:46.020 --> 18:49.660
so I was demoted to local administrator!

18:49.660 --> 18:51.480
It's what they call a relegation!

18:51.480 --> 18:52.600
What?!

18:52.600 --> 18:56.610
But you said you wanted to see 
people's smiles in person...

18:56.840 --> 18:59.110
Oh, that was a lie!

18:59.110 --> 19:00.860
What?!

19:00.860 --> 19:03.780
Are gods allowed to lie?!

19:03.780 --> 19:05.660
Gods <i>are</i> the law,

19:05.660 --> 19:07.750
and laws are made to be broken!

19:07.750 --> 19:09.250
<i>What a lousy god!</i>

19:09.500 --> 19:13.340
But it's true that I want 
to make this world better!

19:13.540 --> 19:16.610
And I'm going to give you two bonus circles,

19:16.610 --> 19:19.700
one for coming here today

19:19.700 --> 19:22.850
and one for keeping my secret for me.

19:32.980 --> 19:34.530
Mother, may I see that?

19:41.940 --> 19:44.270
Thank you for today, Mother.

19:44.270 --> 19:47.200
I fulfilled my dream of 
seeing a god thanks to you.

19:47.520 --> 19:50.040
I'm very grateful to you.

19:50.040 --> 19:51.640
Shalsha...

19:53.470 --> 19:55.130
Me, too! Me, too!

19:55.730 --> 19:59.640
Those Slime Snacks were super yummy!

19:59.640 --> 20:01.880
I love you, Mama!

20:02.130 --> 20:03.940
Falfa!

20:05.490 --> 20:08.020
Your mama loves you both, too!

20:09.640 --> 20:13.480
Master, you created a new 
specialty for Flatta.

20:13.790 --> 20:17.110
And having a specialty helps a village grow.

20:17.390 --> 20:19.610
That's more virtue for you.

20:19.850 --> 20:21.820
Thanks, Halkara!

20:22.090 --> 20:23.610
Then I'll add one, too!

20:24.360 --> 20:27.590
I'll be grateful to for my 
whole death, forever and ever!

20:27.590 --> 20:29.620
I'll follow you to the end!

20:32.870 --> 20:34.740
Thank you, too, Rosalie!

20:35.030 --> 20:37.000
I'll draw one, too!

20:37.430 --> 20:40.690
You have to say what virtue 
Lady Azusa has earned.

20:40.690 --> 20:42.440
I know that!

20:42.440 --> 20:47.640
The fact that Master is my 
master is a virtue in itself!

20:48.920 --> 20:50.890
Thanks, Flatorte.

20:51.300 --> 20:52.850
Then I'll add one, as well.

20:54.670 --> 20:59.940
Lady Azusa, thank you for 
always being our support.

21:00.200 --> 21:05.700
It's thanks to you that we can all live 
fun, peaceful lives in this house.

21:07.370 --> 21:08.450
Laika...

21:09.060 --> 21:10.230
Everyone...

21:10.740 --> 21:11.890
Thank you!

21:12.210 --> 21:14.540
I'll return this favor to all of you, too.

21:14.540 --> 21:16.990
Let's make Virtue Stamp Cards for all of you!

21:16.990 --> 21:18.360
Yay!

21:18.360 --> 21:19.960
Let's do it!

21:18.360 --> 21:19.960
Yes, let's!

21:20.320 --> 21:24.840
<i>It's been 300 years since the goddess 
reincarnated me into this world.</i>

21:25.260 --> 21:27.910
<i>I do things that aren't 
very witch-like sometimes,</i>

21:28.200 --> 21:30.990
<i>but this is the one thing 
I can say with confidence:</i>

21:31.510 --> 21:34.980
<i>I am the happiest witch who ever lived,</i>

21:34.980 --> 21:37.800
<i>with the best family anyone could have!</i>

23:09.950 --> 23:12.450
<b>Days in the Highlands</b>

23:10.700 --> 23:12.450
Days in the Highlands!

23:12.670 --> 23:16.450
<i>This is delicious! 
It's packed with Lady Azusa's love!</i>

23:16.450 --> 23:18.710
<i>I could eat these forever!</i>

23:19.080 --> 23:21.240
<i>We could make a fortune off of these.</i>

23:23.360 --> 23:25.070
<i>She's plotting something dastardly again.</i>

23:27.280 --> 23:31.340
Um, Goddess... I have a favor to ask...

23:31.570 --> 23:33.470
Sure! What is it?

23:33.770 --> 23:37.390
Well... If you could make my chest bigger—

23:37.390 --> 23:38.480
Nope!
